<div class="cover">
  <h1 class="first">ROCA NPD</h1>
  <div class="sub">End-to-End Code Review Guide — Complete Implementation</div>
  <p class="meta">Project start → Sprint 1 → Sprint 2 → Material Master / SAP Post to SAP / Audit Log &nbsp;|&nbsp; 05 October 2026</p>
  <p class="meta">Covers every implemented <code>.tsx</code> / <code>.ts</code> module under <code>src/webparts</code>, <code>src/store</code>, and <code>src/External</code></p>
</div>

<div class="note">
  <b>Reading convention.</b> <code>.tsx</code> = React presentation and composition (what the user sees).
  Companion <code>.ts</code> / hooks = orchestration, validation, Redux dispatch, service calls.
  Feature screens must not import <code>primereact/*</code> for form controls — they use <code>components/common/controls</code>.
  JSX never calls SharePoint or SAP directly — only thunks → CommonServices → <code>SPServices</code> / SAP helpers.
</div>

<h1 class="first">0. Table of contents</h1>
<ol>
  <li>Application overview</li>
  <li>Architecture &amp; data flow</li>
  <li>Web part bootstrap (RocaNpd + NpdApproverMail)</li>
  <li>SharePoint lists, ROCA masters, SAP API, Config / Interface</li>
  <li>Redux store — every slice and thunk</li>
  <li>CommonServices — every service file</li>
  <li>Common UI controls, master panels, hooks, import/export</li>
  <li>Layout &amp; navigation — every component</li>
  <li>Routing &amp; protection</li>
  <li>NPD Request module — every .tsx / .ts</li>
  <li>Material Group module — every .tsx / .ts</li>
  <li>Administration — every master</li>
  <li>NPDApproverMail components</li>
  <li>End-to-end lifecycle flows</li>
  <li>Code review checklist</li>
</ol>

<h1>1. Application overview</h1>
<p>ROCA NPD is an enterprise SharePoint Framework (SPFx) client-side suite:</p>
<ul>
  <li><b>RocaNpd</b> — main workbench: NPD requests, Material Group requests, Admin masters, Material Master.</li>
  <li><b>NpdApproverMail</b> — Outlook / SafeLinks action page for Approve / Rework / Reject with <code>ActionVia = Mail</code>.</li>
</ul>
<p><b>NPD:</b> Initiator create → Draft / Submit (Material Master duplicate validation + progress) → Vertical Head Approve / Rework / Reject →
MIS Other Details → Post to SAP (<code>createZMatMast</code>, one call per Item Details line) → set <code>NPD_ItemDetails.SAP</code> → insert
<code>NPD_MaterialMaster</code> (<code>ItemType=New</code>, display + LookupCode columns) → Approve only when all lines succeed.</p>
<p><b>Material Group:</b> Category cards → grids → Draft / Submit → VH → Consultant Complete → auto-insert <code>NPD_Lookup</code> (<code>LookupCode = Code</code>).</p>

<h1>2. Architecture &amp; data flow</h1>
<table>
  <tr><th>Layer</th><th>Choice</th><th>Location</th></tr>
  <tr><td>Host</td><td>SPFx 1.23.2 / SharePoint Online</td><td><code>RocaNpdWebPart.ts</code>, <code>NpdApproverMailWebPart.ts</code></td></tr>
  <tr><td>UI</td><td>React 17 + PrimeReact 10 (wrapped)</td><td><code>components/common/controls/</code></td></tr>
  <tr><td>State</td><td>Redux Toolkit</td><td><code>src/store/</code></td></tr>
  <tr><td>SharePoint</td><td>PnPjs v4 <code>spfi</code> + SPFx</td><td><code>SPServices.ts</code></td></tr>
  <tr><td>SAP</td><td>REST <code>createZMatMast</code></td><td><code>sapMaterialMaster*.ts</code></td></tr>
  <tr><td>Routing</td><td>HashRouter</td><td><code>AppRoutes.tsx</code></td></tr>
  <tr><td>Styles</td><td>SCSS modules + theme</td><td><code>theme.scss</code>, <code>*.module.scss</code></td></tr>
</table>
<pre>WebPart.onInit → loadApplicationStyles
WebPart.render → RocaNpd / NpdApproverMail
  → setupSP(spfi SPFx) + setupSpfxContext
  → Provider(store)
      MainComponent → initializeApp → AppShell → AppRoutes → feature screens
        → dispatch(thunk) → CommonServices → SPServices / SAP fetch
        → slice update → re-render</pre>

<h1>3. Web part bootstrap</h1>
<h2>3.1 RocaNpd</h2>
<table>
  <tr><th>File</th><th>Kind</th><th>What it implements</th><th>Uses / used by</th></tr>
  <tr>
    <td><code>src/webparts/rocaNpd/RocaNpdWebPart.ts</code></td>
    <td>.ts SPFx</td>
    <td><code>onInit</code> loads application styles; <code>render</code> mounts React; property pane; <code>lockWebPartViewport</code></td>
    <td>Creates <code>RocaNpd.tsx</code></td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><code>components/RocaNpd.tsx</code></td>
    <td>.tsx class root</td>
    <td>Builds <code>SPFI</code> with SPFx context; <code>setupSP</code> + <code>setupSpfxContext</code>; wraps children in Redux <code>Provider</code></td>
    <td>RocaNpdWebPart → MainComponent</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><code>components/IRocaNpdProps.ts</code></td>
    <td>.ts props</td>
    <td>description, theme, Teams flags, userDisplayName, context</td>
    <td>RocaNpd.tsx</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><code>components/MainComponent.tsx</code></td>
    <td>.tsx</td>
    <td>Restores email <code>npdRoute</code> query to hash (SafeLinks); dispatches <code>initializeApp</code>; flash toasts; global <code>LoaderOverlay</code>; <code>HashRouter</code> → AppShell → AppRoutes; chrome lock; <code>injectRocaPrimeOverrides</code></td>
    <td>RocaNpd.tsx</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><code>components/IMainComponentProps.ts</code></td>
    <td>.ts props</td>
    <td>spfxContext, sp</td>
    <td>MainComponent</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><code>loc/mystrings.d.ts</code></td>
    <td>.ts</td>
    <td>Localization typings for web part strings</td>
    <td>RocaNpdWebPart</td>
  </tr>
</table>

<h2>3.2 NpdApproverMail</h2>
<table>
  <tr><th>File</th><th>Kind</th><th>What it implements</th><th>Uses / used by</th></tr>
  <tr><td><code>NpdApproverMailWebPart.ts</code></td><td>.ts SPFx</td><td>Styles + render mail root</td><td>SharePoint page hosting mail actions</td></tr>
  <tr><td><code>components/NpdApproverMail.tsx</code></td><td>.tsx</td><td>setupSP; mounts App</td><td>WebPart</td></tr>
  <tr><td><code>components/INpdApproverMailProps.ts</code></td><td>.ts</td><td>Props with context</td><td>NpdApproverMail.tsx</td></tr>
  <tr><td><code>components/NpdApproverMailApp.tsx</code></td><td>.tsx</td><td>Composes Loader / ActionPanel / Result; wires Toast callbacks</td><td>NpdApproverMail.tsx</td></tr>
  <tr><td><code>components/useNpdApproverMailController.ts</code></td><td>.ts</td><td>Parse query params; token/identity validation; apply workflow; ActionVia=Mail; duplicate prevention</td><td>NpdApproverMailApp</td></tr>
  <tr><td><code>components/NpdApproverMailLoader.tsx</code></td><td>.tsx</td><td>Centered dual concentric rings (inner rotates, outer static)</td><td>App while processing</td></tr>
  <tr><td><code>components/NpdApproverMailActionPanel.tsx</code></td><td>.tsx</td><td>Remarks UI for Rework/Reject from mail</td><td>App when remarks required</td></tr>
  <tr><td><code>components/NpdApproverMailResult.tsx</code></td><td>.tsx</td><td>Top banners: success / already submitted / error</td><td>App after processing</td></tr>
  <tr><td><code>loc/mystrings.d.ts</code></td><td>.ts</td><td>String typings</td><td>WebPart</td></tr>
</table>

<h1>4. Data stores — lists, masters, SAP, Config, Interface</h1>
<table>
  <tr><th>List / API</th><th>Site</th><th>Primary services / UI</th><th>Key fields / notes</th></tr>
  <tr><td>NPD_LookupType</td><td>NPD</td><td>lookupTypeService + LookupTypeMaster</td><td>Name/Title; IsDeleted soft delete</td></tr>
