  <tr><td>NPD_Request</td><td>NPD</td><td>npdRequestGeneralInfoService</td><td>RequestId, Status, WorkFlowJSON, Other Details; Title empty</td></tr>
  <tr><td>NPD_ItemDetails</td><td>NPD</td><td>npdItemDetailsService</td><td>Line items; SAP boolean; request lookup</td></tr>
  <tr><td>NPD_ApproverComments</td><td>NPD</td><td>npdApproverCommentsService</td><td>ApproverRole, Action, ActionVia, ActionOn; Title empty</td></tr>
  <tr><td>NPD_MaterialMaster</td><td>NPD</td><td>materialMasterService + MaterialMaster UI</td><td>ItemType Old/New; display + *Code; NPDRequest</td></tr>
  <tr><td>NPD_MaterialGroupConfig</td><td>NPD</td><td>materialGroupService</td><td>Category definitions</td></tr>
  <tr><td>NPD_MaterialGroupRequests</td><td>NPD</td><td>materialGroupService</td><td>JSON entries, Status; Title empty</td></tr>
  <tr><td>NPD_MaterialGroupAuditLogs</td><td>NPD</td><td>materialGroupAuditLogService</td><td>ActionVia System|Mail</td></tr>
  <tr><td>ApproversMaster, BrandMaster, PlantMaster, RoleMaster</td><td>ROCA</td><td>roleService, rocaMasterDataService</td><td>Roles/brands/plants</td></tr>
  <tr><td>createZMatMast</td><td>External</td><td>sapMaterialMasterService</td><td>POST body = [one TY_DATA object]; status True/False</td></tr>
</table>
<p><b>Config.ts</b> — single source for ListNames, FieldNames, FieldLabels, Routes, Roles, statuses, valuation classes,
SapMaterialMasterApi URLs, email query keys, MaterialMasterItemTypes, ImportExport rules, TextInputRules.</p>
<p><b>Interface.ts</b> — DTOs for lookups, NPD form/list/item/other-details, workflow steps, Material Master rows,
Material Group payloads, ApproversMaster / resolved access.</p>
<p><b>ISPServicesProps.ts</b> — typings for PnP service helpers.</p>

<h1>5. Redux store — every file</h1>
<p>Entry <code>src/store/index.ts</code> registers reducers. Typed hooks in <code>hooks.ts</code>. <code>rootState.ts</code> exports RootState.
<code>uiProcessing.ts</code> — <code>beginUiProcessing</code> / <code>finishUiProcessing</code> for global loader / item progress.</p>
<table>
  <tr><th>File</th><th>Responsibility</th><th>Consumers</th></tr>
  <tr><td><code>slices/appSlice.ts</code></td><td>User identity, roles, brands, initialized, roleStatus</td><td>MainComponent, nav, ProtectedRoute</td></tr>
