<p>Also: <code>src/External/Loader/Loader/Loader.tsx</code> + <code>index.ts</code> — shared loader used by control <code>LoaderOverlay</code>.</p>
<p>Offline helper (not runtime UI): <code>scripts/verifySapMaterialMaster.ts</code> verifies payload/response behaviour.</p>

