<h1>13. NPDApproverMail behaviour</h1>
<ul>
  <li>Query params: requestId, action, token, approverEmail, system (Config.NpdApproverMail / NpdEmail).</li>
  <li>Controller validates token &amp; identity; blocks duplicate / already-acted.</li>
  <li>Uses same workflow + ApproverComments services as in-app; ActionVia = Mail.</li>
  <li>Loader: viewport-centered dual rings; Result: top banners.</li>
  <li>Reuses rocaNpd Toast helpers.</li>
</ul>

<h1>14. End-to-end lifecycle flows</h1>
<h2>14.1 NPD</h2>
<pre>Initiator /npd/new
  → NpdRequestForm + useNpdRequestFormController
  → Save Draft (Title="") / Submit
       → validate → validateItemsAgainstMaterialMaster → progress UI
       → RequestId + WorkFlowJSON pending VH → email
VH /npd/pending → Approve|Rework|Reject → ApproverComments → Audit Log
MIS → Other Details → Post to SAP
  → createZMatMast per SAP=false line → SAP=true → MM ItemType=New (+ Code columns)
  → all success → Status=Approved; else keep partial + do not approve
Approved /npd/approved → Other Details read-only for all roles</pre>
<h2>14.2 Material Group</h2>
<pre>/mg/new → SelectMasters → MasterDetails → Draft/Submit
VH → Consultant / Rework / Reject
Consultant Complete → NPD_Lookup insert (LookupCode=Code) → Completed</pre>
<h2>14.3 Admin</h2>
<pre>Admins → /admin/* masters → thunks → services → soft delete / dependency checks
Material Master catalog Old + New (New from SAP success)</pre>

<h1>15. Code review checklist</h1>
<ul>
  <li>No feature screen imports <code>primereact/*</code> form controls directly.</li>
  <li>No SharePoint/SAP calls inside .tsx (only thunks/services).</li>
  <li>Title empty on NPD_Request, ApproverComments, MG request/audit adds.</li>
  <li>ActionVia Mail vs System on NPD and MG audit lists.</li>
  <li>Post to SAP: array-of-one body; FERT/HAWA; LookupCode; SAP flag; MM insert; approve only if all succeed.</li>
  <li>Audit Pending placeholders match by ApproverRole only (dual-role safe).</li>
  <li>Lookup auto-refresh on navigation.</li>
  <li>Tab lock prevents dual-edit corruption.</li>
  <li>ProtectedRoute + filterNavigationByRoles + brand scopes.</li>
  <li>Material Master Existing vs New column rules and paging.</li>
</ul>

<p class="meta" style="text-align:center;margin-top:24pt;">
ROCA NPD • Complete End-to-End Code Review • All implemented .tsx / .ts modules • 05 October 2026
</p>
